'''Takamaicán''' ({{IPA-bl|takaˈmaikan}}) is an underground [[W:Metro station|station]] of the [[Castejón Metro]] serving the [[Takamaicán|eponymous barrio]] on the  [[Sagrajas]] and [[Castejón Metro Takamaicán Line|Takamaicán]] lines, located in the [[Coruxón]] borough of the [[Castejón Metropolis]]. 

